=4 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:NOTE:}** You must zone after completing the previous quest before you can start this quest.
* Talk to {n:Tosuka-Porika}.
* Talk to {n:Furakku-Norakku} behind the counter in the same room.
** {n:Furakku-Norakku} tells you that {n:Hae Jakkya} at the {z:Windurst Woods} {z:Auction House} has an overdue romance novel called {k:"A Song of Love"}. He provides you with an {k:Overdue book notification|Overdue book notification (Song)}
